{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名佛說\n施色力經"}
{"id": null, "n": "0855001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0855001", "type": "mod", "text": "施食【大】，食施【宋】【元】，此經明本今以宋元對校之"}
{"id": null, "n": "0855002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0855002", "type": "mod", "text": "人名【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0855001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0855001", "type": "orig", "text": "此經明本今以宋元對校之，施食＝食施【宋】【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0855002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0855002", "type": "orig", "text": "〔人名〕－【宋】【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0855001", "target": "#nkr_note_rest_0855001", "type": "rest", "text": "此經明本今以宋元對校之"}
